OL,3,GNEWSAMan who set fire to police van at
OL,4,Ademo jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who set fire to a police van
OL,7,Fduring a city centre demonstration has
OL,8,Fbeen jailed.
OL,10,FHakam Ghaith poured accelerant onto the
OL,11,Fvan and set it alight during a protest
OL,12,Fthat took place around Calverley Street
OL,13,Fin Leeds on 1 November 2025, a court
OL,14,Fheard.
OL,16,FThe 25-year-old, of no fixed abode,
OL,17,Fpleaded guilty to arson with
OL,18,Frecklessness to whether life was
OL,19,Fendangered and was sentenced to six
OL,20,Fyears and eight months at Leeds Crown
OL,21,FCourt earlier.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
