OL,3,GNEWSAMan who set fire to police van at
OL,4,Ademo jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA West Yorkshire Police spokesperson
OL,7,Fsaid Ghaith did not know if anyone was
OL,8,Fin the van at the time and there was
OL,9,F"potential for others in the vicinity
OL,10,Fto be hurt".
